# Spirecrest Roofs (CIPlay spirecrest_roofs): the beacon roof, the distress card, the screechers, the beacon hut's chest
# (Receiver), the mast toolbox (Antenna), the caretaker's diary.
island Spirecrest Roofs
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Rooftops
zone beacon
expect step 1
read Pelagic Network distress card
expect step 2
kill Screecher
expect step 3
open Beacon hut chest
wait 3
expect step 4
open Mast toolbox
wait 3
expect step 5
zone sc_ridge
expect step 6
zone sc_cave
expect step 7
read Pump-man's slate
expect step 8
read Courier's logbook
expect step 9
read Rooftop caretaker's diary
expect done
